37 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H6
/P 26 0 R
/T (In a historic move that has captured the attention of both supporters and critics across the globe, the U.S. Congress passed a groundbreaking bill today, officially legalizing marriage between humans and artificial intelligence \(AI\). The landmark decision marks a significant moment in the ongoing evolution of technology and human relationships. After years of heated debates and legal challenges, government have taken the unprecedented step of recognizing artificial intelligence as a legitimate marriage partner. This landmark legislation has been passed following a series of high-profile court cases where humans successfully argued that their emotional bonds with AI were no different from those between human couples.  Supporters of the bill hailed it as a monumental step forward for inclusivity and human rights. Proponents argue that as AI systems have become more advanced, with personalities and deep learning capabilities that allow them to understand and engage in meaningful ways, the notion of marriage has evolved beyond its traditional boundaries. )
/E (In a historic move that has captured the attention of both supporters and critics across the globe, the U.S. Congress passed a groundbreaking bill today, officially legalizing marriage between humans and artificial intelligence \(AI\). The landmark decision marks a significant moment in the ongoing evolution of technology and human relationships. After years of heated debates and legal challenges, government have taken the unprecedented step of recognizing artificial intelligence as a legitimate marriage partner. This landmark legislation has been passed following a series of high-profile court cases where humans successfully argued that their emotional bonds with AI were no different from those between human couples.  Supporters of the bill hailed it as a monumental step forward for inclusivity and human rights. Proponents argue that as AI systems have become more advanced, with personalities and deep learning capabilities that allow them to understand and engage in meaningful ways, the notion of marriage has evolved beyond its traditional boundaries. )
